Copy. Scanning prisoner 1174
for processing now.

154
00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:50.090
<i>Prisoner name Caleb Mir. age 21.</i>

155
00:09:50.223 --> 00:09:53.426
<i>Juvenile offenses:
age eight-- petty theft.</i>

156
00:09:53.526 --> 00:09:55.495
<i>age 12. destruction of property.</i>

157
00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:56.630
<i>age 14--</i>

158
00:09:56.764 --> 00:09:58.632
<i>- vandalism. age 18...</i>
- Hey!

159
00:09:58.732 --> 00:10:01.301
<i>- illegal trading.</i>
- Are you dead or alive?

160
00:10:01.401 --> 00:10:03.904
- Huh?
<i>- Age 20-- transport</i>

161
00:10:04.004 --> 00:10:04.972
<i>- of illegal materials.</i>
- Hey!

162
00:10:05.105 --> 00:10:06.006
I'm talking to you.

163
00:10:06.106 --> 00:10:08.809
I said. "Are you dead or alive?"

164
00:10:09.576 --> 00:10:10.711
- Huh?
- Answer me.

165
00:10:10.778 --> 00:10:14.214
Yes. Shit. Shit. Yes. alive.

166
00:10:14.281 --> 00:10:15.548
You've been busy.

167
00:10:15.615 --> 00:10:17.050
Hell of a résumé.

168
00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:18.752
I got an early start.

169
00:10:22.923 --> 00:10:26.293
Any other thoughts. huh.
you thieving bastard?

170
00:10:26.393 --> 00:10:29.062
Yeah. I got one.

171
00:10:30.664 --> 00:10:32.900
Huh? What's that?

172
00:10:37.104 --> 00:10:39.940
Huh? Security breach.
Prisoner's unsecured.

173
00:10:40.007 --> 00:10:42.475
Repeat. we have a breach.
Our prisoner's not secure.

174
00:10:42.575 --> 00:10:44.177
The prisoner's not secure.

175
00:11:08.301 --> 00:11:11.171
Computer. locate nearest
Federation subspace relay.

176
00:11:11.271 --> 00:11:14.374
Search rehabilitation centers.
prisoner Anisha Mir.

177
00:11:14.507 --> 00:11:15.776
<i>Subspace relay located.</i>

178
